			<comment>* SCRIPT NAME: ZH.Calculate.Scaling</comment>
		</line>
		<line linenr="003" indent="">
			<comment>* DESCRIPTION: Calculates a percentage to scale main factions' and OCV fleets. Used by Mayhem.Squadron.GetGlobalNeeds and Mayhem.Monitor.OCV.</comment>
		</line>
		<line linenr="004" indent="">
			<comment>* The percentage is based on the player's supply consumption. If within consumption, scaling is 100%. if above, scaling caps at 400%.</comment>
		</line>
		<line linenr="005" indent="">
			<comment>* It steps up in 25% increments if (player's supply consumption - current scaling) &gt;= 25. Otherwise steps up by the difference.</comment>
		</line>
		<line linenr="006" indent="">
			<comment>* Steps down in 10% increments if (current scaling - player's supply consumption) &gt;= 10. Otherwise steps down by the difference.</comment>
		</line>
		<line linenr="007" indent="" />
		<line linenr="008" indent="">
			<comment>* AUTHOR:           DATE: 4 February 2026</comment>
		</line>
